; A pending value owns a shared cursor: aliases resume its latest state.
; An already completed cursor returns its result without republishing it.
; Execution keeps the bound language handle; its component data is read at
; preparation and observation boundaries, rather than copied at every tick.
(= (lang:resume $pending $budget)
   (if (langdef:natural-budget? $budget)
     (case $pending
       (((LangPendingV1 $cursor) (lang-internal:work $cursor $budget))
        ($other (LangArgumentErrorV1 Continuation $other)))){$cursor $other}
